T*
(Mon\054 Jun 22\054 2026 at 9\07218 AM) Tj
T*
(9\07218 AM Daniel\072 Celeris flagged the account again yesterday\056 Did you use it again\077) Tj
T*
(9\07220 AM Marco\072 I only opened the app for a minute\056) Tj
T*
(9\07221 AM Daniel\072 I told you not to use my account\056) Tj
T*
(9\07223 AM Marco\072 I didn\047t do any deliveries\056 I just looked at it\056) Tj
T*
(9\07224 AM Daniel\072 That\047s still my driver account\056 Don\047t log into it anymore\056) Tj
T*
(9\07226 AM Marco\072 Okay\056) Tj
T*
(9\07227 AM Daniel\072 I\047m serious\056 I don\047t want Celeris closing my account\056) Tj
T*
